garbled": false, "novel_title": "来到春秋当月神", "content_zh": "第七章来求援的伍绪洛思琪被小师弟叫到清元子房间的时候，唐小虾已经在那里了。一路上洛思琪看到了十几名身穿军装的士兵，他们列队在清元子的房外站好，洛思琪也不知道怎么了。清元子房间里的陌生人，便是突然来求救的伍绪了。伍绪穿着将官的衣服，手中还紧握着一把比较普通的偏将用的长剑，看他的样子已经是万分的焦急了，待到见洛思琪进来，他便在清元子的示意下，开始细说他来的目的。原来费无忌在楚王面前对太子建的谗言是一日更甚一日，为了消除楚王的疑虑，惩治费无忌这个小人，伍子胥的父亲伍奢不顾太子和儿子的劝阻，只带了几个身边的护卫就去国都了。自他走后，太子和伍奢的两个儿子一直都觉得忐忑不安，直到今天从楚都终于传来消息，楚王还是听信了费无忌的谗言决定消除祸患，不仅囚禁了伍奢，还传令城父司马奋扬将太子建与伍奢的两个儿子绑赴国都，奋扬不忍执太子，便提前告诉他让他跑了，而伍奢的两个儿子由于事先不知情，便被包围在了伍奢的府中。费天忌向楚王进言，派人传话给伍奢的两个儿子，说如果他们去楚都表明并无反意，就放了他们父子，否则便要将他们的父亲斩首。伍尚性格仁厚，又至孝，便要束手就擒。伍子胥对他说道：“费无忌恨不得我们家的三个男子全都死掉，这样他做起坏事来才没有后顾之忧，我们即使去了，也不过是和父亲一起死罢了，还不如逃出去，徐图以后为父亲报仇！”伍尚认同了弟弟的说法，但却让弟弟自己走，他对伍子胥说：“我不忍让父亲独死，报仇的事情交给你，我去国都吧！”伍绪对大家说：“当时情况紧急，表哥便让我来这里请求你们的帮助，他仗剑执弓，杀出重围，因为来抓他的也都是我们伍家从前的手下，所以只是虚张声势，阻挡几下便任由他去了。”洛思琪对伍绪说的事情还是知道一点的，史记上记载，伍尚到了国都便和伍奢一起被处死了，而伍子胥找到太子一起到达了郑国，倾覆楚国的火种便在此时产生了。她也很快便知道了伍绪此来的目的，那就是希望清元子能派出弟子在去楚都的路上追上押送伍尚的队伍，将其救出来，甚至潜入楚都，凭借强大的能力，救出伍奢，刺杀费无忌！清元子听伍绪说完便点了点头，对伍绪说：“我同意派出弟子去救人，你先出去稍等片刻，待我交代这两名弟子几件事！”伍绪对清元子深施一礼道：“多谢您愿意出手相救，情况紧急，希望您的徒弟能尽早与我前去。”清元子答应了，对他说：“很快的，你放心吧！”伍绪便转身退了出去，屋子里只剩下清元子和洛思琪加唐小虾三个人。唐小虾见伍绪出去了，便开口问清元子：“纯真，你真的打算让我们去救伍尚他们？”清元子点了下头表情严肃，但还是答道：“不错！我看费天忌这个人心狠手辣，想必很难放过他们！如果你们不去救，伍奢和伍尚就死定了！”唐小虾像听到了很好笑的事情一样，他对清元子说：“别逗了，纯真，你既然能知道现代的许多事情，自然这个时代的事情你也都知道了，在史记中伍尚和伍奢是注定要死的，别说伍尚和伍奢要死，就连太子建都要死在郑国，然后才有了伍子胥逃到吴国借师伐楚，刨坟分掘墓，这些都是注定的，你要我们两个去也没有，何况我们两个现在能力平平，去了没准还会把自己给搭进去！”洛思琪在心中也是认同唐小虾的观点的，不料清元子却说出了一句让她有些错愕的话。他说：“那只是史记中记载的罢了，史记的作者要比你们现在生活的时代晚上很多年，要是你们救出了伍尚和伍奢，司马迁写史记的时候便会写出另外一种内容了！”“您，您是说要改变历史？”洛思琪很是吃惊，不过唐小虾却一言不发，这和他的性格很是不符，按理说他应该说出许多反对这样的话才对。“改变历史怎么了？”清元子笑着说道：“为师最近一直在苦苦思考为何你手上的七彩玲珑石的颜色不再变浅了，刚才伍绪来报伍家父子遇险的事情使我突然有了灵感，我既然出现在了这个时代并获得上古密卷，你们也被我召唤到了这里，那么七彩玲珑石一定和这个时代的事情有密切的关系。那到底是什么密切的关系呢？那一定是和伍子胥有最大的关系！”清元子见洛思琪还是有些不明白，不禁仔细解释道：“在这个时期，最重大的事情便是记入史记的伍子胥复仇的事件，也就是说，要想弄清楚七彩玲珑石的奥秘，有可能就要和伍子胥扯上关系，不管是邪神千方百计想要杀我，还是你们要通过七彩玲珑石回到现代，伍子胥就好比贯穿所有节点的一个引子，也就是说，只有和他扯上关系的事情才能给我们关于接下来该怎么做的启发。”清元子说的貌似很有道理，但洛思琪还是觉得这有点太冒险了，万一七彩玲珑石和伍子胥没有关系，凭她和唐小虾现在的武功很可能事情还没搞明白呢，两人就先死了。她把征询的目光看向唐小虾，却发现唐小虾坐在椅子上有点发呆了，感觉到洛思琪看他，才回过神来对她说：“我感觉这老头的话有道理！”既然唐小虾也同意，而且目前的确对七彩玲珑石也没什么办法了，洛思琪便也点头同意了。清元子见两人都同意，便继续说道：“这是你们第一次出门，尽管你们已经从我这里学了些本领，可这次前去福祸难料，一切都想必困难重重，有什么要求，你们尽可以说。”洛思琪一时想不出要提什么要求，唐小虾却说话了，他对清元子说：“纯真，我有一个要求！”洛思琪疑惑的看向他，不知道他这个时候会提什么要求。清元子点点头笑着说：“你尽管说，能办到的，我一定尽力替你办到！”唐小虾的要求让洛思琪万万没有想到。因为他说的竟然是：“纯真，此次路途遥远，还不知道要去多久，你得多给我们带些钱！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 7 When Wu Xuluo Siqi, who came to ask for help, was called to Qing Yuanzi's room by his junior brother, Tang Xiaoxia was already there. Along the way, Luo Siqi saw a dozen soldiers in military uniforms. They lined up and stood outside Qing Yuanzi's room. Luo Siqi didn't know what was going on. The stranger in Qing Yuanzi's room was Wu Xu who suddenly came to ask for help. Wu Xu was wearing the clothes of a general, and he was holding a relatively common long sword for generals in his hand. He looked extremely anxious. When he saw Luo Siqi coming in, at Qing Yuanzi's signal, he began to elaborate on the purpose of his visit. It turned out that Fei Wuji's slander against Prince Jian in front of the King of Chu was getting worse day by day. In order to eliminate the suspicion of the King of Chu and punish Fei Wuji, Wu Zixu's father Wu She ignored the dissuasion of the prince and his son and went to the capital with only a few bodyguards. Since he left, the prince and Wu She's two sons have always felt uneasy. Until today, news finally came from the Chu capital. The King of Chu still listened to Fei Wuji's slander and decided to eliminate the trouble. He not only imprisoned Wu She, but also issued an order. City father Sima Fenyang kidnapped Prince Jian and Wu She's two sons to the capital. Fenyang couldn't bear to hold the crown prince, so he told him in advance to let him run away. Wu She's two sons were surrounded in Wu She's mansion because they didn't know about it in advance. Fei Tianji advised the King of Chu and sent a message to Wu She's two sons, saying that if they went to the capital of Chu to show that they had no objection, they would be released, otherwise their father would be beheaded. Wu Shang is kind-hearted and filial, so he will be captured without hesitation. Wu Zixu said to him: \"Fei Wuji wishes that all three men in our family would die, so that he would have no worries when he does bad things. Even if we go, we will just die with our father. We might as well escape, Xu I want to avenge my father in the future!\" Wu Shang agreed with his younger brother, but let him go alone. He said to Wu Zixu: \"I can't bear to let my father die alone. I will leave the matter of revenge to you. I will go to the capital!\" The situation was urgent, so my cousin asked me to come here to ask for your help. He held a sword and a bow and fought his way out of the siege. Because the people who came to arrest him were also former subordinates of our Wu family, so it was just a bluff. After a few blocks, he was allowed to go. \"Luo Siqi still knows a little about what Wu Xu said. Historical records record that Wu Shang and Wu She were executed together with Wu She when they arrived in the capital. Wu Zixu found the prince and arrived in Zheng together. The fire that overthrew the Chu State was born at this time. She also soon learned the purpose of Wu Xu's visit, which was to hope that Qing Yuanzi could send his disciples to catch up with the team escorting Wu Shang on the way to Chudu, rescue him, and even sneak into Chudu, using his powerful ability to rescue Wu She and assassinate Fei Wuji! Qing Yuanzi nodded after hearing what Wu Xu said and said to Wu Xu: \"I agree to send disciples to rescue people. You go out and wait for a while while I explain a few things to these two disciples!\" Wu Xu bowed deeply to Qing Yuanzi and said: \"Thank you for your willingness to help. Rescue, the situation is urgent, I hope your apprentice can go with me as soon as possible.\" Qing Yuanzi agreed and said to him: \"It will be soon, don't worry!\" Wu Xu turned and retreated, leaving only Qing Yuanzi and Luo Siqi plus Tang Xiaoxia. When Tang Xiaoxia saw Wu Xu going out, he asked Qing Yuanzi: \"Innocent, do you really want us to rescue Wu Shang and the others?\" Qing Yuanzi nodded with a serious expression, but still replied: \"That's right! I think Fei Tianji is a cruel person, so it must be difficult. Let them go! If you don't save them, Wu She and Wu Shang will be dead!\" Tang Xiaoxia said to Qing Yuanzi as if he had heard something funny, \"Don't be ridiculous, Innocence, since you can know many things in modern times, naturally there are things in this era. You all know the love. In the historical records, Wu Shang and Wu She were destined to die. Not to mention Wu Shang and Wu She, even Prince Jian had to die in the state of Zheng. Then Wu Zixu fled to the state of Wu to borrow troops to attack Chu, and dug up graves separately. These were all destined. You don't want the two of us to go, not to mention that our abilities are mediocre now, and we might get ourselves involved if we go!\" Luo Siqi also agreed with Tang Xiaoxia's point of view in her heart, but Qing Yuanzi said something that made her a little surprised. He said: \"That's just what is recorded in the Historical Records. The author of the Historical Records was many years later than the time you live in now. If you rescued Wu Shang and Wu She, Sima Qian would have written something else when he wrote the Historical Records!\" \"You, you mean to change history?\" Luo Siqi was surprised, but Tang Xiaoxia remained silent. This was very inconsistent with his character. Logically speaking, he should have said a lot of objections to this. \"What happened to changing history?\" Qing Yuanzi said with a smile: \"Master, I have been thinking hard recently about why the color of the colorful exquisite stone in your hand is no longer lighter. Just now, Wu Xu came to report that the Wu family and his son were in danger, which suddenly inspired me. Since I appeared in this era and obtained the ancient secret Juan, you were also summoned here, so the colorful exquisite stone must be closely related to the events of this era. So what kind of close relationship is it? It must be the biggest relationship with Wu Zixu!\" Seeing that Luo Siqi was still confused, Qing Yuanzi couldn't help but explain carefully: \" During this period, the most important thing was the revenge incident of Wu Zixu recorded in historical records. In other words, if you want to figure out the secret of the colorful exquisite stones, you may have to have something to do with Wu Zixu. Whether the evil god is trying every possible means to kill me, or you want to return to modern times through the colorful exquisite stones. \"Wu Zixu is like an introduction that runs through all the nodes, that is to say, only things related to him can give us inspiration on what to do next.\" What Qing Yuanzi said seems to make sense, but Luo Siqi still feels that this is a bit too risky, in case the colorful Linglong Stone and Wu.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}